WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:02.030
See a spill in the walkway?

2
00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:04.810
Stop and keep people away.

3
00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:08.180
Tell your supervisor,

4
00:00:08.430 --> 00:00:11.490
then follow your workplace procedure
to block off the area

5
00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:12.950
before anyone walks through.

6
00:00:14.530 --> 00:00:16.230
Use a clear alternative route.

7
00:00:17.110 --> 00:00:19.470
Don't step over the spill
or move the barrier.

8
00:00:21.210 --> 00:00:23.830
Keep the area closed
until the hazard is corrected

9
00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:25.530
and the walkway is safe.
